WEBVTT

00:02:57.101 --> 00:03:00.549
if you're lonely, you're more likely
to become depressed.

00:03:00.573 --> 00:03:03.684
If, when you go to work,
you don't have any control over your job,

00:03:03.708 --> 00:03:05.604
you've just got to do what you're told,

00:03:05.628 --> 00:03:07.517
you're more likely to become depressed.

00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:10.025
If you very rarely get out
into the natural world,

00:03:10.049 --> 00:03:11.918
you're more likely to become depressed.

00:03:11.942 --> 00:03:15.053
And one thing unites a lot of the causes
of depression and anxiety

00:03:15.077 --> 00:03:16.252
that I learned about.

00:03:16.276 --> 00:03:18.339
Not all of them, but a lot of them.

00:03:18.363 --> 00:03:20.029
Everyone here knows

00:03:20.053 --> 00:03:22.712
you've all got natural
physical needs, right?

00:03:22.736 --> 00:03:23.910
Obviously.

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:26.513
You need food, you need water,

00:03:26.537 --> 00:03:28.767
you need shelter, you need clean air.

00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:30.585
If I took those things away from you,